			],
			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Rewrap documentation and reformat tables in README\n\nRewrap prose paragraphs in README.md and DeepDive.md to a consistent 100-character column width for improved readability in terminal and diff views. Reformat all markdown tables in README.md with proper alignment markers and consistent column spacing.\n\nAlso add a trailing newline to .commit_message.json to satisfy POSIX file conventions.\n\nNo content changes — purely cosmetic reformatting.",
